### TeamForge Phase 12 API Tests (REST Client Format)
### Stuck Projects, Requests and Inactivity (Zombie Project Breaker, Request Timeout, Early-Withdraw Refund, Abandoned Owner, Inactive Collaborator)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@superUserToken = Bearer YOUR_SUPERUSER_TOKEN_HERE
@adminToken = Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
@ownerToken = Bearer YOUR_OWNER_TOKEN_HERE
@collabToken = Bearer YOUR_COLLABORATOR_TOKEN_HERE

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. OWNER VIEW TRACKING & EARLY-WITHDRAW REFUND (< 2h & Unviewed)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1a. Applicant Submits Join Request
# Expected Status: 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/join-requests
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
x-user-id: 7
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "proj-1",
  "message": "Applying to contribute to the frontend."
}

###

### 1b. Early Withdraw Within 2 Hours (Before Owner Views -> Slot Restored)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Requests used remains 0 (slot refunded)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/join-requests/REQ_ID
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
x-user-id: 7

###

### 1c. Owner Views Project Join Requests (Sets viewedAt on Pending Requests)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/join-requests?projectId=proj-1
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
x-user-id: 1

###

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. INACTIVE COLLABORATOR: RELEASE TASKS (KEEP MEMBERSHIP & IN-REVIEW TASKS)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2a. Owner Releases Inactive Member's Open & In Progress Tasks
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Returns: { released: N, taskIds: [...], tasks: [...] }
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/proj-1/members/2/release-tasks
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
x-user-id: 1

###

### 2b. Collaborator Attempt to Release Tasks (Forbidden)
# Expected Status: 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/proj-1/members/2/release-tasks
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
x-user-id: 2

###

### 2c. Repeat Release When No Open/In-Progress Tasks Remain
# Expected Status: 409 Conflict
# Expected Code: NOTHING_TO_RELEASE
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/proj-1/members/2/release-tasks
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
x-user-id: 1

###

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. ABANDONED OWNER (30-DAY ELIGIBILITY) & ADMIN MANUAL CLOSE
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3a. Collaborator Requests Close (Before 30d Inactive)
# Expected Status: 409 Conflict
# Expected Code: NOT_ELIGIBLE
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/proj-1/request-close
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
x-user-id: 2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Owner has been inactive for over 30 days."
}

###

### 3b. Collaborator Requests Close (After 30d Owner Inactivity Flag)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Creates a 'Project Closure Request' ticket in SupportService
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/proj-1/request-close
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
x-user-id: 2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Owner inactive for 30+ days."
}

###

### 3c. Admin Closes Project with Reason 'Owner inactive' (Settles Escrow via Phase 9)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/projects/proj-1/close
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
x-user-id: 3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Owner inactive"
}

###

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. HOURLY SCHEDULER TICK & JOB RUN LOG
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4a. Super User Manually Runs Hourly Tick (Runs All 9 Jobs Including Zombie Breaker, Stale Request Closer, Inactivity Notifiers)
# Expected Status: 202 Accepted
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobs/tick
Authorization: {{superUserToken}}
x-user-id: u-superuser

###

### 4b. View Job Run History (Admin or Super User)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobs/runs
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
x-user-id: 3
